# The build context is this folder, and two things in it must never enter the
# image: a `node_modules` from the host — which would land on top of the one
# `npm ci` just produced, with whatever platform's binaries it was built for —
# and a `dist` from a previous local build, which would be overwritten by the
# real one but not before being copied.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.astro
**/.DS_Store
